			<div class="content" id="post-content-3568974">
									

<p>It's interesting, but I think it's a little too subtle. In particular, the penultimate paragraph of the description, the one concerning accountability, could be more clearly worded. On my first and second reads through, I read it that accountability was <em>required</em> for the effects to occur, not the other way around. This seemed to fit with the Incident report—as soon as accountability disappeared, so did effects. However, I don't think this was what you were going for.</p>
<p>I like it, but I would prefer a little less obliqueness. I'm close to an up vote, but I think SCPs that require reading of the comments to come to an understanding are problematic.</p>

